{
  "openapi": "3.1.0",
  "info": {
    "title": "deltd API",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "description": "docs/deltd-api-v1.md. Implemented subset: Session (§6.1, sign-in through deltos-identityd, docs/identityd.md), Library (§6.2) and Search (§6.3) groups and /status. Every endpoint except sign-in needs identityd's session cookie (delt_session, or __Host-delt_session over HTTPS). Every POST, PUT and DELETE needs Origin equal to the WebOS origin and, once signed in, X-Delt-CSRF equal to the session's csrf_token. Pack content is served on pack hostnames, not here (§4)."
  },
